      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The avatar of the late joiner, as seen by other users, appears at the origin momentarily and remains at the spawn point for the duration of Initializing world...\n\nIn addition, Join Notification is displayed when the late joiner becomes visible to other users.\n\nThe late joiner’s local Udon’s OnPlayerJoined will fire at the correct time that the world becomes visible. However, other players’ OnPlayerJoined will be fired during Initializing world...\n\nAll of these must be timed to match the timing of the late joiner’s OnPlayerJoined.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
