      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name}: It is definitely still happening. But rather it is really an issue, I don't know. Mainly in worlds where main gathering point is at 0,0,0, you can occasionally see a joining player's avatar loading diamond at 0,0,0 appear for a split second.\n\nAside from seeming weird, I don't think it really hurts anyone though. Unless Udon actually registers them as being there, but that is not my area of expertise.",
