  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Since the last big update users avatars (not their viewpoint though) spawn first at x y z 0,0,0 while their avatars are loading in for the first time. After they have loaded in, their avatars jump back to the right place. In some cases this can be very annoying, because they are not where they are supposed to be, for example in front of a stage or in the middle of a room because it was built around the zero coordinates of the world.",
